# k.faces/shards/pixel-art-slots: the slots of the DiceBear style `pixel-art`: the box that the variants of each slot fill in the 0 to 100 frame of the face, and the draw order.
# sources: dicebear-pixel-art 67f54a0 (DiceBear style "pixel-art", CC0 1.0: "Pixel Art" (https://www.figma.com/community/file/1198754108850888330) by "DiceBear", licensed under "CC0 1.0" (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/))
